{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"da36e5cfa6fa7ed643ca4cfc6777fcc33e6d71281c79e4621cb6ae155dee326e","ja":"水着の衣装で？","zh":"穿着泳装？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b784acd34a6641fe1b6305f523fc24b2a586065687b564c8787f3832ce9c220e","ja":"風花と千鶴は貴音を探し始めたが、\nなかなか見つからなくて……","zh":"风花和千鹤开始寻找贵音，\n却迟迟找不到人……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4c6709bbdbba2c39806844255b2716af9b2bc4bfac026cc0637b7d9816cb5afd","ja":"……こちらにもいませんわね。\nあらっ……！","zh":"……这边也没有呢。\n哎呀……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fd1afc15f38008947247518185fc4dc3d12ee5d56335ea82c5788278b6e3d8aa","ja":"らんらんら～ん♪\nあっ、風花さんと千鶴ちゃんだ！","zh":"啦啦啦～♪\n啊，是风花小姐和小千鹤！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"cdff26f6a6fe094bf916f335ec19a2039e5d82b25b0e108ddf126fcf6c28e453","ja":"やっほーっ！！\nこんなところでどうしたんですか？","zh":"呀吼——！！\n你在这种地方做什么呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ceafbf8e3817bf42ac3708a057102aa4445a71cd3dea136f8e13ab55e4f395e3","ja":"ちょうど良かった！　今、貴音ちゃんを探してたの。\nもうすぐ出番なのに見当たらなくって……。","zh":"太巧了！我正找贵音呢。\n马上就轮到她出场了，却怎么都找不着人……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9589dc2255f644aae2344ef23ed18eb85f1da3c0fb4b82d67b0a2e2b68b57ee0","ja":"麗花は、貴音がどこにいるか知りませんこと？","zh":"丽花，您可知道贵音在哪儿吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f2c80a6e2f7d1e63343d1ff095f5d16fa5e48e0173d71b7dca1e78d0be660e04","ja":"貴音ちゃんですか？　う～ん……あっ！\nもしかしたらラーメン屋さんに行ってるかも。","zh":"贵音吗？唔～……啊！\n说不定是去拉面店了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"164fa8d8d00fe27c9dffd7c06e70917f9570050c3072eb010816f5d15a7c130e","ja":"えっ、ラーメン屋さんに！？","zh":"诶，去拉面店吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cd3afcb7012cf0839a189617928e30ca0bbba64341681f2e02078ef10f259763","ja":"うん！　ほら、この前のイベントのフードエリアに\n『サイケデリックラーメン』ってあったでしょ？","zh":"嗯！你看，之前活动的餐饮区里\n不是有一家“迷幻拉面”吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6325aae27af5b111dd6a3dc8bd56ba57d73cd1a718788478f4e2ba9813886ff3","ja":"あれを作ったお店が、この近くにあるってお話し\nしてたから、食べに行ったんじゃないかなって♪","zh":"之前聊天时提到做那个的店就在这附近，\n所以我想是不是去吃了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0a67694b492f8872056708e36be5f806d1f82c729a1172fe771723575ebb7f30","ja":"で、でも、貴音は衣装に着替えてますわよね……？","zh":"可、可是，贵音不是已经换好服装了吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1267.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7fd2796e75029e228e5fbdbfb5f9ac31d6b2389d292b9e225e7bb8d78173c97d","ja":"も、もしかして……水着の衣装のまま、\n外に食べに行っちゃったの～っ！？","zh":"难、难道说……你就直接穿着泳装，\n跑到外面去吃了吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
